    <briefdescription>
<para>Specialisation of <computeroutput><ref refid="class_d_mat_lin_alg" kindref="compound">DMatLinAlg</ref></computeroutput> for <computeroutput>ARingZZpFFPACK</computeroutput> dense matrices, delegating rank / determinant / kernel / solve / inverse to the FFPACK library&apos;s tuned <computeroutput>Z/p</computeroutput> routines. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>FFPACK gives near-BLAS speed for dense linear algebra over <computeroutput>Z/p</computeroutput> by laying entries out as native floats. The specialisation forwards each query through the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespaceffpack_interface" kindref="compound">ffpackInterface</ref></computeroutput> shims declared just above and returns the result as a fresh <computeroutput><ref refid="class_d_mat" kindref="compound">DMat</ref>&lt;ARingZZpFFPACK&gt;</computeroutput>. The preferred backend for primes that fit comfortably in a single-precision float. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
